=== Rotate an API key :: intro
Rotate keys every *90 days*, or right away if one leaks.
=== Rotate an API key :: prerequisites
Admin access to the console.
=== Rotate an API key :: items[0].body
Creating a new key **revokes** the old one immediately. Update these first:
1. The CI secret
2. Local `.env` files
=== Rotate an API key :: items[1].title
Open **Settings → API keys**
=== Rotate an API key :: items[2].title
Enter your password to confirm
=== Rotate an API key :: items[2].description
Password input is masked while recording.
=== Rotate an API key :: items[3].title
Click **Create key** and copy the new key
=== Rotate an API key :: items[3].description
The key is shown **once**. Store it in your password manager; see [Managing keys](https://example.com/docs/keys).
=== Rotate an API key :: items[4].title
Drag the new key to **Production**
=== Rotate an API key :: items[5].title
Check that the key works
=== Rotate an API key :: items[5].description
Run this in Terminal:

`curl -H "x-api-key: $KEY" https://api.example.com/v1/ping`

It should print *pong*.
=== Share a calendar event :: intro
This guide shows how to invite someone to an event you **already** created.
=== Share a calendar event :: prerequisites
- A Mac signed in to iCloud
- An existing event
=== Share a calendar event :: items[1].title
Click **Calendar** in the Dock
=== Share a calendar event :: items[2].title
Double-click the *Team sync* event
=== Share a calendar event :: items[2].description
The event opens in its own window.
=== Share a calendar event :: items[3].body
You can also select the event and press `⌘O` to open it.
=== Share a calendar event :: items[5].title
Type the guest's email in **Add Invitees**
=== Share a calendar event :: items[5].description
Separate several guests with commas.
- Guests get an email invite
- You can remove them later
=== Share a calendar event :: items[6].title
Right-click the guest and choose **Send Email**
=== Share a calendar event :: items[7].title
Press `⌘S` to save
=== Share a calendar event :: items[8].body
Guests see changes after they [refresh their calendar](https://support.apple.com/guide/calendar/welcome/mac).
